# Ship only the runtime. Everything is excluded first, then the runtime
# files are listed explicitly, so new tooling or local state (for example
# .simai/, mirai/, work/) can never leak into the package.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!images/icon.png
!data/*.json
!out/*.js
!out/providers/*.js
!out/registry/*.js
